| Law | 5 Home Estates, Family Estates | Crown demesne limit `+1`. |
| Guile (Guile) | 1 Ominous Reputation, Ominous Reputation | Dread gain `+20%`. This is not an effect that instantly adds 20 to current dread. |
| Guile | 2 Long Reach, Far-Reaching Hand | Hostile scheme success chance in the family of `+10`. Known as a success-rate modifier from before the scheme overhaul; the current unit of the value is unconfirmed. |
| Guile | 3 Natural Schemers, Natural Schemers | Intrigue lifestyle experience `+10%`. |
| Guile | 4 Venial, Lenient Interpretation | Tyranny gain `-20%`. It does not nullify tyranny. |
| Guile | 5 Family Connections, Family Connections | Known as an effect linked to defending against hostile schemes targeting dynasty members and to obtaining information on the opponent upon failure. **The exact current trigger and modifier are unconfirmed**, so figures such as a fixed -50% defense are not asserted. |
| Blood (Bloodline) | 1 Noble Veins, Noble Blood Vessels | A `+30%` series to the chance of passing down or newly generating good innate traits. Do not assume it is a flat 30 percentage point addition to the probability. |
