## 11.1 Core·Data·Foundation

Seoul fact: Per https://github.com/islee23520/seoul-dengoku/blob/3e3c03349eafaaf88347d119a4bdd0c6d44abc53/AGENTS.md#L66-L71, Janseon.Core is engine-independent, Data projects authored ScriptableObjects into validated immutable catalogs, and Foundation is the Unity/VContainer integration. The Bootstrap→MainTitle→Foundation flow and the per-screen child scopes and uGUI builders/presenters are maintained. Diagrams in the documents are not the implemented UI.

## 11.2 Balance Authoring and References

Seoul fact: Follows the rule versions, drift validation, and serialized asset references in GAME/Assets/Janseon/Data/Authoring/BattleSetupDefinition.cs:10-25 and Data/Validation/GameDataCatalogValidator.cs:30-32. Maintains the rules in https://github.com/islee23520/seoul-dengoku/blob/3e3c03349eafaaf88347d119a4bdd0c6d44abc53/AGENTS.md#L70-L71: authoring through the Unity API, preserving meta files/GUIDs, and no arbitrary replacement of validators. CK3 reference: the separation of coefficients, structure, and narrative in internal-architecture-synthesis.md:95-104 and mechanics-05-economy.md:54-95 is an optional authoring convention. Product authority: apart from approved data, all actual balance values are not yet decided.

## 11.3 Backend Session Coordinator

Seoul fact: https://github.com/islee23520/seoul-dengoku/blob/3e3c03349eafaaf88347d119a4bdd0c6d44abc53/AGENTS.md#L75-L76 specifies .NET 8 ASP.NET Core, a single Kestrel REST/raw WebSocket endpoint with default port 1219, and volatile in-process sessions. Game simulation is owned by the host client and is not moved to a Backend game-rules server. The current SP-1.0.0 loop is not overridden by historical shared-world or online-proxy clauses.

## 11.4 POC, Debug, and Historical Boundaries

Seoul fact: The realtime-formation-card, left/right presentation, and Oddland assets in https://github.com/islee23520/seoul-dengoku/blob/3e3c03349eafaaf88347d119a4bdd0c6d44abc53/AGENTS.md#L59-L62 are historical POCs and not combatants of the new product. The POC seed and morale rule versions are not product balance. CK3 reference: the console registration and gating in binary-rea-04-decompiled.md:328-386 are an investigation method. Product authority: whether to introduce Seoul debug tools at all is not yet decided; Ghidra project recovery is not described as a product feature.

