## Execution Gate for Unconfirmed Integration

Strategic time conversion depends on the open-decision ledger OD-MOVE and product authority. Until the Estate WorldSeconds→world Tick alignment is closed, no integration that assumes production, movement, and activity share a single cycle is finalized. Because CWS1 covers world facts only, no claim is made of complete full-campaign recovery including purpose-specific random numbers, events, and receipts. Save format/version support and lineage recovery boundaries are decision gates under ADR-008, the open-decision ledger OD-SESS, and product authority, and no new migration defaults are invented. This gate is not a new game rule that halts existing implementations; it is a documentation boundary against promoting unconfirmed meanings to completed implementation.', '# CH11 구현 매핑

