| 운용 — 독립 가족 작업 | d08.b9.orderedSteps[8] | "For joint property, compare the exact signer set with the exact current-owner set; if equal, emit only a D13 contract-eligible receipt, not a title transfer." |
| 운용 — 등록 관할·권한·경로 | d08.b9.orderedSteps[9] | "For adoption, require named participant consents, then require an approved registered procedure. Without the procedure, preserve records and return undetermined-procedure."​ |
