| 운용 — 현재 판본·행위 선택 | d13.b11.approvedInvarian​ts[10].statement | "Unregistered price versions lock signing and settlement; no duplicate demand of one ledger asset; V<=W is not automatic acceptance. Lock closure input, recheck continuing CB validity and eligible beneficiary first; an already invalid CB follows invalidation instead of generating rights even at W=100. With a valid CB, reaching +/-100 before acceptance closes under that CB version first and discards unaccepted proposals. Rights go to eligible beneficiary, not commander/approver by role. Same-boundary acceptance/100/death use established event order/version for a single settlement. Signed items remain campaign delivery/performance obligations, not inventory copies." |
| 운용 — 현재 판본·행위 선택 | d13.b11.approvedInvarian​ts[10].source | "sp1.b34, sp1.b119, sp1.b121, sp1.b124-b127, sp1.reference.beneficiar​y" |
