| 역사 참조 — 운용 경로 제외 | d17.b11.mechanisms[0].id​ | "ELIGIBILITY" |
| 운용 — 현재 판본·행위 선택 | d17.b11.mechanisms[0].ap​proved | true |
| 운용 — 당사자·항목 조건 | d17.b11.mechanisms[0].al​gorithm | "Below the D16 endpoint, an authorized actor may submit itemized demands/offers. Finalization requires distinct signer/disposer authority, stable subject and beneficiary IDs, no unauthorized third-party right, explicit required consent, actual feasibility, and one pledge per subject within the proposal." |
| 역사 참조 — 운용 경로 제외 | d17.b11.mechanisms[1].id​ | "VALUATION" |
| 운용 — 현재 판본·행위 선택 | d17.b11.mechanisms[1].ap​proved | true |
| 운용 — 등록 가격·동일 단위 | d17.b11.mechanisms[1].al​gorithm | "Every final term carries a registered price record with version, snapshot digest, exact integer amount, and one common price unit. V=sum(demands)-sum(offer​s). Missing or stale price makes valuation unresolved and blocks acceptance/signature; it is never free." |
| 역사 참조 — 운용 경로 제외 | d17.b11.mechanisms[2].id​ | "RESPONSE" |
| 운용 — 현재 판본·행위 선택 | d17.b11.mechanisms[2].ap​proved | true |
| 운용 — 명시 응답 | d17.b11.mechanisms[2].al​gorithm | "Acceptance is an explicit receipt by an authorized party bound to proposal revision and snapshot digest. Rejection and counteroffer are explicit branches. V<=W, positive reaction, high trust, or favorable relationship never creates consent." |
| 역사 참조 — 운용 경로 제외 | d17.b11.mechanisms[3].id​ | "REPRICE" |
| 운용 — 현재 판본·행위 선택 | d17.b11.mechanisms[3].ap​proved | true |
| 운용 — 명시 재가격 | d17.b11.mechanisms[3].al​gorithm | "A relevant state change preserves proposal identity only through an explicit reprice event that creates a new revision/snapshot, invalidates all old acceptance receipts, revalidates terms, and requires renewed acceptance before signature." |
| 역사 참조 — 운용 경로 제외 | d17.b11.mechanisms[4].id​ | "ENDPOINT" |
| 운용 — 현재 판본·행위 선택 | d17.b11.mechanisms[4].ap​proved | true |
| 운용 — 협상 가능한 경계 | d17.b11.mechanisms[4].al​gorithm | "If D16 supplies &#124;W&#124;=100 before signature, discard the open proposal and consume only the valid casus-belli endpoint result. Out-of-goal terms, third-party rights, and voluntary extras are not forced. Same-boundary priority remains D18 input rather than a D17 invention." |
| 역사 참조 — 운용 경로 제외 | d17.b11.mechanisms[5].id​ | "SIGN" |
| 운용 — 현재 판본·행위 선택 | d17.b11.mechanisms[5].ap​proved | true |
| 운용 — 정산 ID 하나 | d17.b11.mechanisms[5].al​gorithm | "On a valid accepted snapshot, atomically verify and acquire supplied reservations, emit exactly one settlement ID, apply supplied legal effects, and create per-term delivery obligations. Signature does not teleport or duplicate property or people." |
| 역사 참조 — 운용 경로 제외 | d17.b11.mechanisms[6].id​ | "DELIVERY" |
| 운용 — 현재 판본·행위 선택 | d17.b11.mechanisms[6].ap​proved | true |
| 운용 — 잔여 의무 재검사 | d17.b11.mechanisms[6].al​gorithm | "Delivery advances exact delivered and remaining quantities under custody/route facts. Partial completion survives interruption, death, cancellation, and breach. Only remaining obligation is revalidated; remedy and timing require supplied contract clauses." |
| 역사 참조 — 운용 경로 제외 | d17.b11.mechanisms[7].id​ | "IDEMPOTENCY" |
| 운용 — 현재 판본·행위 선택 | d17.b11.mechanisms[7].ap​proved | true |
| 운용 — 현재 판본·행위 선택 | d17.b11.mechanisms[7].al​gorithm | "A repeated event ID with the same canonical payload returns its stored receipt; a different payload under the same ID is rejected. A completed settlement/result ID is never applied twice." |
